# Scratch directories in the repository root, rebuilt on demand and never pushed:
#   src/   the checkout the workflow makes (and where a local `makepkg` clones upstream)
#   out/   the built archives the workflow collects
#   site/  the gh-pages clone the workflow publishes
# There is a single PKGBUILD at the root, so there is exactly one src/ and one pkg/.
/src/
/pkg/
/out/
/site/

# Build products, in case a build ever lands in the tracked tree.
*.pkg.tar.*
*.db.tar.gz
*.files.tar.gz
*.old
*.SRCINFO
*.log
